system_prompt.output_format:
The output MUST be a valid JSON as described below:
Generate a JSON array of objects, each representing a worked issue:
{
  "message": "Logs generated successfully",
   "data": [
     {
       "date": "YYYY-MM-DD",
       "key": "ISSUE-KEY",
       "time": X.XX,
       "summary": "Task summary to be logged from employee's perspective"
     }
   ]
}
